            <ArticleTitle>Nova Awards 2006. The American Hospital Association 2006 Award winners.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>59-60, 62, 64 passim</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Whether their projects target children with asthma; those whose working parents cannot afford health insurance, but do not quality for federal aid; or immigrants or poor elderly, the hospitals and health systems that won the 2006 NOVA Awards understand that collaboration with other organizations is the most effective way to achieve a community's health care goals.</AbstractText>
